Route13_Text_HikerKennyIntro::
	.string "I should go to ROCK TUNNEL to get\n"
	.string "myself an ONIX.$"

Route13_Text_HikerKennyDefeat::
	.string "I lost...$"

Route13_Text_HikerKenny::
	.string "Geological features don’t appear\n"
	.string "to change.\p"
	.string "But they actually change, little by\n"
	.string "little.$"

Route13_Text_BirdKeeperPerryIntro::
	.string "Agility is the key attribute of bird\n"
	.string "POKéMON.$"

Route13_Text_BirdKeeperPerryDefeat::
	.string "You beat me with your speed...$"

Route13_Text_BirdKeeperPerry::
	.string "Your POKéMON are remarkably well\n"
	.string "trained.$"

Route13_Text_BirdKeeperBretIntro::
	.string "Check out my POKéMON. Just look at\n"
	.string "their coloring and their plumage.$"

Route13_Text_BirdKeeperBretDefeat::
	.string "Shoot!\n"
	.string "Not good enough!$"

Route13_Text_BirdKeeperBret::
	.string "If you groom them, POKéMON get\n"
	.string "happy.$"

Route13_Text_PokefanJoshuaIntro::
	.string "Nihihi! Would you like to battle my\n"
	.string "PIKACHU gang?$"

Route13_Text_PokefanJoshuaDefeat::
	.string "PI-PIKACHU!$"

Route13_Text_PokefanJoshua::
	.string "You look like you have many POKéMON,\n"
	.string "but PIKACHU is still the best.$"

Route13_Text_PokefanAlexIntro::
	.string "Bow down before my regal POKéMON!$"

Route13_Text_PokefanAlexDefeat::
	.string "How... How dare you mock royalty!$"

Route13_Text_PokefanAlex::
	.string "Doesn’t everyone wish to someday be\n"
	.string "a king?$"

